---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Navbar from '../components/Navbar.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Why BarkHaus" description="BarkHaus is being built to give animal rescues one connected place for animal records, websites, applications, and outreach.">
  <Navbar currentPage="/about" />
  <main><section class="bh-page"><div class="bh-container"><p class="bh-overline">OUR PURPOSE</p><h1>More room for care. Less work between tools.</h1><p class="bh-lead">Rescue teams do extraordinary work with limited time. BarkHaus exists to make the information behind that work easier to manage and easier to share.</p></div></section>
  <section class="bh-feature bh-feature-light"><div class="bh-container bh-feature-grid"><div class="bh-feature-visual"><img src="/images/barkhaus_dog_and_vet.png" alt="A dog receiving attentive care" loading="lazy" width="960" height="720" /></div><div class="bh-feature-copy"><p class="bh-overline">WHY WE'RE BUILDING THIS</p><h2>Every handoff matters.</h2><p>A rescued animal's story passes through intake, care, a public profile, conversations with adopters, and a final status update. When those details are scattered, the work of keeping everyone current falls on already busy teams.</p><p>We are building BarkHaus around a simple idea: the animal record can be a shared source of truth for the people caring for them and the experiences that help them find a home.</p></div></div></section>
  <section class="bh-cta"><div class="bh-container bh-cta-inner"><div><p class="bh-overline">A CONVERSATION STARTS HERE</p><h2>Built with rescue teams in mind.</h2><p>Tell us where your current workflow gets stuck and what would help.</p></div><a class="bh-button bh-button-light" href="/contact">Get in touch ↗</a></div></section></main><Footer />
</BaseLayout>
